{"seq":1,"slug":"async-await","title":"async/await 异步等待","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/concurrency/async-await","wordCount":762,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"async-await-异步等待\">async/await 异步等待</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Swift 5.5 引入了 async/await（SE-0296），将异步编程从回调嵌套（callback hell）转变为线性的、类似同步代码的编写方式。async/await 是 Swift 并发模型的基础，配合 async sequences、throwing async 和 continuation bridge，构成了完整的异步编程体系。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    AA[&quot;async/await&quot;] --&gt; SF[&quot;异步函数&quot;]&#10;    AA --&gt; AS[&quot;Async Sequences&quot;]&#10;    AA --&gt; TA[&quot;Throwing Async&quot;]&#10;    AA --&gt; CB[&quot;Continuation Bridge&quot;]&#10;    SF --&gt; SUS[&quot;挂起点 suspension point&quot;]&#10;    SUS --&gt; RES[&quot;恢复执行&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    AA[\"async/await\"] --&gt; SF[\"异步函数\"]\n    AA --&gt; AS[\"Async Sequences\"]\n    AA --&gt; TA[\"Throwing Async\"]\n    AA --&gt; CB[\"Continuation Bridge\"]\n    SF --&gt; SUS[\"挂起点 suspension point\"]\n    SUS --&gt; RES[\"恢复执行\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>async/await 用「挂起」取代「阻塞」，把回调嵌套改写成线性代码。其核心思想是：异步函数在遇到 <code>await</code> 时<strong>挂起</strong>并<strong>释放线程</strong>，而不是占着线程空等；异步操作完成后，运行时再调度一个线程从挂起点<strong>恢复</strong>。围绕这一模型有几个关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>挂起点（Suspension Point）</strong>——<code>await</code> 标记的位置，线程在此可被回收去执行其他任务；</li>\n<li><strong>async 函数</strong>——必须从 async 上下文调用，入口可以是 <code>Task {}</code>、<code>@main</code> 的 <code>async main</code> 或 SwiftUI 的 <code>.task</code>；</li>\n<li><strong>AsyncSequence</strong>——<code>Sequence</code> 的异步版本，支持 <code>for await</code> 遍历与链式操作；</li>\n<li><strong>Continuation</strong>——把传统回调 API 桥接到 async/await 的机制，必须<strong>恰好 resume 一次</strong>；</li>\n<li><strong>执行模型</strong>——调用 → 挂起点释放线程 → 线程池调度 → 操作完成后从挂起点恢复。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括：<strong>async/await 让异步代码拥有同步代码的可读性，靠挂起点 + 线程释放实现非阻塞。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"异步函数基础\">异步函数基础</h2><p>使用 <code>async</code> 关键字标记异步函数，使用 <code>await</code> 在调用点挂起：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func fetchUser(id: String) async throws -&gt; User {&#10;    let url = URL(string: &quot;https://api.example.com/users/\\(id)&quot;)!&#10;    let (data, response) = try await URLSession.shared.data(from: url)&#10;&#10;    guard let httpResponse = response as? HTTPURLResponse,&#10;          httpResponse.statusCode == 200 else {&#10;        throw NetworkError.invalidResponse&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    return try JSONDecoder().decode(User.self, from: data)&#10;}&#10;&#10;func displayUser() async {&#10;    do {&#10;        let user = try await fetchUser(id: &quot;123&quot;)&#10;        print(user.name)&#10;    } catch {&#10;        print(&quot;Failed: \\(error)&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> url </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.example.com/users/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(id)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (data, response) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> URLSession.shared.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: url)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    guard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> httpResponse </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HTTPURLResponse,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          httpResponse.statusCode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NetworkError.invalidResponse</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSONDecoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(User.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> displayUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    do</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user.name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Failed: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(error)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>await</code> 是一个<strong>挂起点（suspension point）</strong>，线程在此处可以被释放去执行其他任务，而不是阻塞等待。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> async 函数只能从 async 上下文中调用。入口点可以是 <code>Task { }</code> 闭包、<code>@main</code> struct 的 <code>static func main() async</code>、或 SwiftUI 的 <code>.task</code> modifier。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"结构化任务-structured-tasks\">结构化任务（Structured Tasks）</h2><p><code>Task</code> 是启动异步工作的基本单位：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"Task {&#10;    let user = try await fetchUser(id: &quot;123&quot;)&#10;    await MainActor.run {&#10;        nameLabel.text = user.name&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;Task.detached(priority: .background) {&#10;    await performHeavyWork()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MainActor.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        nameLabel.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Task.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">detached</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .background) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> performHeavyWork</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Task 类型</th>\n<th>继承上下文</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Task { }</code></td>\n<td>继承 actor、优先级</td>\n<td>从同步代码启动异步工作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Task.detached { }</code></td>\n<td>不继承</td>\n<td>完全独立的后台任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"async-sequences\">Async Sequences</h2><p><code>AsyncSequence</code> 协议是 <code>Sequence</code> 的异步版本，支持异步产生一系列值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func fetchPages(url: URL) -&gt; AsyncStream&lt;Page&gt; {&#10;    AsyncStream { continuation in&#10;        Task {&#10;            var nextURL: URL? = url&#10;            while let currentURL = nextURL {&#10;                let (page, next) = try await fetchPage(from: currentURL)&#10;                continuation.yield(page)&#10;                nextURL = next&#10;            }&#10;            continuation.finish()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;for await page in fetchPages(url: startURL) {&#10;    print(&quot;Loaded page: \\(page.title)&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchPages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: URL) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AsyncStream&#x3C;Page> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    AsyncStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { continuation </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nextURL: URL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> url</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            while</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentURL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nextURL {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (page, next) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fetchPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24